&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt;Nankai Enviro-Tech Corporationが Tenma America Corporationに、Nankai Mexico,S.A.de C.V.がTENMA PLASTIC MEXICO,S.A.DE C.V.にそれぞれ商号変更。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
